[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 5941.99, "timestamp": "01:39:01", "text": "日本學習語言。所以，是的，回來後我能聽懂，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5946.95, "timestamp": "01:39:06", "text": "但是哦，是的。我可以用哦。哦，是的。日文翻譯器。我知道。我喜歡日語，無論是"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5960.31, "timestamp": "01:39:20", "text": "語言本身或"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5963.35, "timestamp": "01:39:23", "text": "文化"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5966.31, "timestamp": "01:39:26", "text": "等等。就是這樣。我去那裡是為了"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5969.83, "timestamp": "01:39:29", "text": "學習"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5973.109, "timestamp": "01:39:33", "text": "語言、工作等等。所以謝謝你的關注。謝謝。你來自"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5986.31, "timestamp": "01:39:46", "text": "不知道。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5992.79, "timestamp": "01:39:52", "text": "但是，嗯，"}]